      "sample_index": 2,
      "text": "To solve the problem, we need to convert each base-5 number to base-10 and then sum the converted values. Here are the steps:\n\n1. Convert \\(3124_5\\) to base-10.\n2. Convert \\(3122_5\\) to base-10.\n3. Convert \\(124_5\\) to base-10.\n4. Sum the base-10 equivalents.\n\nLet's start with the conversions:\n\n1. \\(3124_5\\) to base-10:\n\\[\n3124_5 = 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0\n\\]\n\\[\n= 3 \\cdot 125 + 1 \\cdot 25 + 2 \\cdot 5 + 4 \\cdot 1\n\\]\n\\[\n= 375 + 25 + 10 + 4\n\\]\n\\[\n= 414_{10}\n\\]\n\n2. \\(3122_5\\) to base-10:\n\\[\n3122_5 = 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 2 \\cdot 5^0\n\\]\n\\[\n= 3 \\cdot 125 + 1 \\cdot 25 + 2 \\cdot 5 + 2 \\cdot 1\n\\]\n\\[\n= 375 + 25 + 10 + 2\n\\]\n\\[\n= 412_{10}\n\\]\n\n3. \\(124_5\\) to base-10:\n\\[\n124_5 = 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0\n\\]\n\\[\n= 1 \\cdot 25 + 2 \\cdot 5 + 4 \\cdot 1\n\\]\n\\[\n= 25 + 10 + 4\n\\]\n\\[\n= 39_{10}\n\\]\n\nNow, sum the base-10 equivalents:\n\\[\n414_{10} + 412_{10} + 39_{10} = 865_{10}\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the total dollar amount that the pirate has accumulated is \\(\\boxed{865}\\).",
