      "text": "To convert the base 5 numbers to base 10 and then sum them up, we proceed as follows:\n\n\\[ 3124_5 \\]\n\\[\n= 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0 \\\\\n= 3 \\cdot 125 + 1 \\cdot 25 + 2 \\cdot 5 + 4 \\cdot 1 \\\\\n= 375 + 25 + 10 + 4 \\\\\n= 414_{10}\n\\]\n\n\\[ 3122_5 \\]\n\\[\n= 3 \\cdot 5^3 + 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 2 \\cdot 5^0 \\\\\n= 3 \\cdot 125 + 1 \\cdot 25 + 2 \\cdot 5 + 2 \\cdot 1 \\\\\n= 375 + 25 + 10 + 2 \\\\\n= 412_{10}\n\\]\n\n\\[ 124_5 \\]\n\\[\n= 1 \\cdot 5^2 + 2 \\cdot 5^1 + 4 \\cdot 5^0 \\\\\n= 1 \\cdot 25 + 2 \\cdot 5 + 4 \\cdot 1 \\\\\n= 25 + 10 + 4 \\\\\n= 39_{10}\n\\]\n\nNow, sum the converted values:\n\\[\n414_{10} + 412_{10} + 39_{10}\n\\]\n\nAdd these numbers step by step:\n\\[\n414_{10} + 412_{10} = 826_{10}\n\\]\n\\[\n826_{10} + 39_{10} = 865_{10}\n\\]\n\nThus, the total dollar amount the pirate has accumulated is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{865}\n\\]",
